板。","nat.lobbyOffline":"以访客身份玩——共享屏幕 2P 在任何地方都可以使用。","Force the corners, own the center.":"强行占领角落，占领中心。","Lesson 1 — Move":"第 1 课 — 移动","Slide your paddle left and right.":"左右滑动桨。","Move your paddle toward the left wall. Drag, use ← →, or tap the left side.":"将桨移向左墙。拖动、使用 ← → 或点击左侧。","Your paddle is the bright bar on your goal line.":"您的球拍是球门线上的亮条。","Now move it toward the right wall.":"现在将其移向右墙。","The paddle follows your pointer or arrow keys.":"控制杆跟随您的指针或箭头键。","Lesson 2 — Serve":"第 2 课 — 发球","Put the ball in play.":"将球投入比赛。","The ball is yours. Press Space, tap the ball, or use the Serve button.":"球是你的。按空格键、点击球或使用发球按钮。","Serving sends the ball toward the far goal line.":"发球将球送向远球门线。","Lesson 3 — Return":"第 3 课 — 返回","Meet the ball with your paddle.":"用球拍击球。","Return the ball once. Get your paddle under it before it crosses your line.":"回球一次。在它越过你的线之前将你的桨放在它下面。","Watch the trail — meet the ball, don’t chase it.":"观察轨迹 — 迎接球，不要追它。","Lesson 4 — Angle":"第 4 课 — 角度","Strike off-center to bend your return.":"偏离中心击球以弯曲你的回球。","Hit the ball with the outer half of your paddle to send it wide.":"用球拍的外半部分击球，将球打偏。","Edge hits bend the return; center hits go straight.":"边缘击球会使返回弯曲；中心击球直线前进。","Lesson 5 — Score & Win":"第 5 课 — 得分与胜利","Score through the far goal line to win.":"通过远球门线得分即可获胜。","Score one point — send the ball past the far paddle, over the far line.":"得一分——将球送过远处的球拍，越过远处的线。","Angled returns are harder to catch.":"角度回球更难接住。","Finish it — win the match.":"完成它——赢得比赛。","First point wins this one.":"第一点获胜。","First Contact":"首次接触","Learn the arena. First to 3, slow ball.":"了解竞技场。第一个到第三个，慢球。","Ignition":"点火","Return Form":"退货表格","Hold your ground and return cleanly.":"坚守阵地，干净利落地回归。","Wide Guard":"宽防护","A wider arena demands anticipation.":"一个更宽的竞技场需要预判。","Edge Work":"边缘工作","Use the paddle edge to bend returns.":"使用桨边缘来弯曲回线。","Tempo":"节奏","The ball gains pace with every hit.":"球随着每次击球而加快速度。","Pressure Line":"压力线","Opponent tracks faster. Stay calm.":"对手跟踪得更快。保持冷静。","Ignition Trial":"点火试验","Prove the basics under margin rules.":"证明保证金规则下的基础知识。","Mastery: Ignition":"精通：点火","Mastery stage — win by 3 against Glide.":"精通阶段——以 3 胜 Glide。","Angles":"角度","Slice":"切片","Sharper returns, sharper angles.":"更锐利的返回、更锐利的角度。","Narrow Margin":"险胜","A slimmer paddle, a slimmer path.":"更细的桨，更细的路径。","Long Court":"朗阁","A longer court rewards deep angles.":"一个更长的球场奖励深角度。","Quickstep":"快步","Faster exchanges. Read the rebound.":"更快的交换。阅读反弹。","Corner Trap":"角落陷阱","Angles Gate":"角度之门","Win with pace against Flow.":"以速度战胜 Flow。","First Bumper":"第一保险杠","A single deflector changes the map.":"一个单一的偏转器改变了地图。","Bumpers":"缓冲器","Mastery: Angles":"精通：角度","Mastery stage — angled returns, no cheap points.":"精通阶段——有角度的回报，没有廉价点。","Twin Deflectors":"双导流板","Two bumpers guard the middle.":"两个保险杠保护中间。","Offset Lanes":"偏移车道","Asymmetric deflectors. Re-read every rebound.":"非对称偏转器。重新阅读每一次反弹。","Pinball":"弹球","Four deflectors. Chaos is a pattern.":"四个偏转器。混沌是一种模式。","Bumper Trial":"缓冲试验","Hold the line amid deflections.":"在偏转中坚守阵线。","Crosswind":"侧风","A moving blocker sweeps mid-court.":"一个移动的阻挡者在中场扫过。","Double Sweep":"双重清扫","Two blockers, alternating pressure.":"两个阻滞剂，交替压力。","Crossfire":"交叉火力","Crossfire Gate":"交叉火力之门","Survive the sweep against Surge.":"在对抗Surge的扫荡中幸存。","Mastery: Crossfire":"精通：交叉火力","Mastery stage — blockers and margin pressure.":"掌握阶段——阻碍因素和保证金压力。","Overdrive":"超速","The pace climbs. So do you.":"步伐加快。你也一样。","Razor":"剃刀","Slim paddle, full speed.":"细长桨，全速。","Deep Court":"深层球场","The longest court at full pace.":"全速行驶的最长球场。","Reactor":"反应器","Deflectors at overdrive pace.":"超速运转的偏转器。","Blitz":"闪电战","Short target, sudden pressure.":"短期目标，突如其来的压力。","Ion Storm":"离子风暴","Blockers sweep a fast court.":"阻挡者横扫快速球场。","Overdrive Gate":"超速门","Hold pace against Pulse.":"保持节奏对抗脉冲。","Mastery: Overdrive":"精通：超速","Mastery stage — full speed, win by 3.":"精通阶段——全速，以3获胜。","Zenith Approach":"天顶方法","The final chapter opens at pace.":"最后一章快速展开。","Mirror Maze":"镜子迷宫","Symmetric deflectors, 